   "widgets_values": [
    "CC Post Sepia Alpha\nA D- symbol becomes a transparent map sprite: blue channel (white paper 1.0, umber ink\n~0.15) -> InvertMask -> MaskComposite add with itself (coverage x2, clamped) -> InvertMask\n-> RGBA -> lanczos 256. No BiRefNet: a line drawing has no silhouette to cut, and the\ndoubled coverage keeps brush edges soft while mid-tone fills go opaque.\nDriven by assets/imagegen/post.py --tier mark.\nPrompt = a STYLE_CORE file + subject + [C-...] canvas, never typed by hand."
   ]
  }
